          "heading": "Questions 11–16",
          "instructions": [
            "Choose the correct letter, A, B or C."
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "q": 11,
              "stem": "The speaker was surprised to discover that",
              "options": {
                "A": "membership of the library had fallen",
                "B": "most loans were for garden tools",
                "C": "many reserved tools were never collected"
              }
            },
            {
              "q": 12,
              "stem": "New members can immediately",
              "options": {
                "A": "book a session in the wood workshop",
                "B": "download the inventory app",
                "C": "join a weekend repair class"
              }
            },
            {
              "q": 13,
              "stem": "What pleased the speaker about the insurance provider was",
              "options": {
                "A": "the low cost of the premium",
                "B": "how quickly a claim was processed",
                "C": "the range of optional extra cover"
              }
            },
            {
              "q": 14,
              "stem": "The speaker had a problem with",
              "options": {
                "A": "a battery charger that overheated",
                "B": "the usage meter on a tile cutter",
                "C": "an online booking that was recorded twice"
              }
            },
            {
              "q": 15,
              "stem": "The next method the library will try is",
              "options": {
                "A": "posting video tutorials",
                "B": "offering more evening drop-in sessions",
                "C": "introducing a locker collection system"
              }
            },
            {
              "q": 16,
              "stem": "The speaker is doubtful about weekend deliveries because",
              "options": {
                "A": "the library van is unreliable",
                "B": "the service would be too expensive to run",
                "C": "insurance would not cover a staffed delivery"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s2-ct-1718",
          "from": 17,
          "to": 18,
          "type": "choose_two",
          "heading": "Questions 17 and 18",
          "instructions": [
            "Choose TWO letters, A–E."
          ],
          "stem": "Which TWO tips does the speaker NOT recommend?",
          "options": {
            "A": "oiling blades before returning them",
            "B": "storing batteries in a refrigerator",
